{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_title", "source_sha256": "3f7c755f52e1c78d958171494f888a4f9a54f237ebdf3d10327e8df7abafc9d1", "ja": "野辺見れば", "zh": "放眼眺原野", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_synopsis", "source_sha256": "654d996716acaef761b4cdc818566cc8cc9e846b47a811fc8d5d3dbfc7689c0d", "ja": "着物工房を紹介する仕事を受けたエミリー。\n外国人着物職人の案内で取材を進めるうちに\n閉鎖的な先代工房長に追い出されるが、自分\nのファンでもあった職人の励ましに意を決し\n先代に真っすぐな想いを伝えるのだった。", "zh": "接下介绍和服工坊工作的艾米莉。\n她在外国和服工匠的带领下进行采访，\n中途虽被思想保守的前任工坊长赶了出去，\n但在身为自己粉丝的工匠鼓励下下定决心，\n向老前辈径直传达了自己的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c33bb9082d5eb76c0d697163f1c20038ba16441caf12c664f2bc4b59317132e7", "ja": "（他のアイドル達の見学許可も無事におり、撮影当日。\n5人と一緒に、お世話になる着物工房にやってきた）", "zh": "（其他偶像们的参观许可也顺利获批了，到了拍摄当天。我们和5个人一起来到了这家承蒙关照的和服工坊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "ef1e7e16fd60ce1fd103e00f7784aa1e38268661082904d2e0a9431ab07318de", "ja": "ここが着物工房……。とても厳粛な空気を感じます！\nはぁぁ、胸の高鳴りが止まりません♪", "zh": "这里就是和服工坊……感觉这里的气氛非常庄严肃穆！\n哈啊啊，心跳得完全停不下来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "9e747e5b0a01f7df56271c1e502d5fa459f5f0d050a030a232ce7173503e0bc5", "ja": "私も！　昨日からドキドキしちゃって、\n布団に入っても全然寝れなかったんだ～。", "zh": "我也是！从昨天开始就一直心跳得好快，躺进被窝也完全睡不着～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1e0764d0076d66fc17ec9203131a84aff871265262b44b62b6bda019e1c35e70", "ja": "楽しみなのはわかるけど、ここは仕事をする場所だ。\nきちんと気を引き締めてな。", "zh": "我知道你很期待，但这里是工作的地方。可得好好打起精神来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b6ae6520c28c4c8c7dec007c5a368bca5522c97918ee3096a599cd0a4a082d77", "ja": "さて、この後はエミリーの撮影に付きっきりになると\n思う。みんなの方も気にかけるつもりだけど……。", "zh": "接下来，我应该会一直陪着艾米莉拍摄。大家那边我也会留意，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "e59812e4f7137fbbea3ead3dfe6818fb5b95e972b100315e1b4465a237b87509", "ja": "見学組は自分がいるから安心していいぞ。\n律子から茜のこと見てるようにって頼まれたし！", "zh": "见习组有我在，放心好了。\n律子还拜托我帮她盯着茜呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "b2484256468410e25802a6ead4f3caed9f154fc5690187e57e528f7b375975ac", "ja": "ウニャ！？　さすが律子さん、抜かりない……！", "zh": "呜呀！？不愧是律子小姐，真是滴水不漏……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9e360e887e52497b1ff342bd71b4f81613175d963cb0f3ca702d252e0826ee8d", "ja": "あはは、一応アタシもいるし。\n響がしっかりしてるから、出番はなさそうだけど。", "zh": "啊哈哈，好歹我也在呢。\n不过响很靠得住，感觉没有我出场的机会就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4703f644dc318cdb1d7a3f6f9d37a4b2c2e4b80d49966adeaf2b7b1f99530b28", "ja": "いや、おかげで安心できるよ。\nそれじゃ、頼んだぞ。", "zh": "不，多亏了你，我就能放心了。\n那就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1011_null", "source_sha256": "41653696cc58b74d90f461b5071b0b8d7ca2c51eb7877fb67a39562da67d4780", "ja": "撮影開始……", "zh": "节目开拍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "52b39fe8971ff1079f2e4bc4933921b163c29309e6a6992d61cc2936d5d80ffd", "ja": "動画をご覧のみなさま、こんにちは。\nエミリー・スチュアートと申します。", "zh": "正在观看视频的各位，大家好。\n我叫艾米莉·斯图尔特。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "e0e7a131bbb0c32b2c6ffbc032f389a24f5334fd3fb156a29ce2fab861ddb077", "ja": "本日は、こちらの工房から反物についてご紹介しようと\n思います。ですが私ひとりでは心もとないので……。", "zh": "今天想在这间工坊为大家介绍反物。不过只靠我一个人，实在有些不放心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "44d9cad384fb55036b22c969349f8f27162b616ca78338679d1896e0838705b6", "ja": "着物職人のポールさんにご案内していただきます。\nこちらへ、どうぞ。", "zh": "接下来请和服工匠保罗先生为我们带路。请这边走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1015_poru", "source_sha256": "3cfcab378d0df85edf98d3b6122e2fa15752a78698c00d7dbee992a2f346ad80", "ja": "みなさん、こんにちワ！　私、ポールといいマス。\nよろしくお願いしマス、エミリーさん。", "zh": "大家，你们好！我叫保罗。\n请多关照，艾米莉小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "460d34fd083412aae3c7efb463afa54859cdea53531d963c49cb476984c6fb2a", "ja": "こちらこそ！　あの、ポールさんは着物職人になるため\n仏蘭西から来日されたと伺ったのですが……？", "zh": "我才要请您多多关照！那个，我听说保罗先生是为了成为和服工匠，从法国来到日本的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1017_poru", "source_sha256": "d91d11c78842389e642c6963c76b66aeeaf4b8ecc5f3b107dc8df9ddbdc53271", "ja": "ハイ。パリで開かれたニホンの文化を紹介する\nイベントで、着物に一目ボレしました！", "zh": "是的。在巴黎举办的介绍日本文化的活动上，我对和服一见钟情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1018_poru", "source_sha256": "e116c0c62c05f60fe5ca15a004e718eaa2ded773b85c8b707cf40f9854e05967", "ja": "着物はアート、芸術デス！　その素晴らしさを、\nもっとニホンの若者にも知ってほしいデス！", "zh": "和服就是艺术，是艺术！希望更多日本的年轻人也能了解它的美好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "44179b55bedefdbba27bc8633a51b75d343d1b37a853b5c94308eab79f391605", "ja": "はい。私も誠心誠意、お手伝いしますね！\nそれでは、早速なのですが……。", "zh": "是的。我也会诚心诚意地帮忙！那么，事不宜迟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b8ec861fae3b727b3fd08d5f6b8f20cdbb4d7cc06bf2bbd95565d85e5f6ceeb3", "ja": "（こうして、エミリーとポールさんによる\nPR動画の撮影が始まった……）", "zh": "（就这样，艾米莉和保罗先生开始拍摄宣传视频了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1021_poru", "source_sha256": "32d496b25d0012723fa24999202e72d5c791842d1e56ddefadb4d293648c4f6e", "ja": "エミリーさん、見てください。\nここでは、仮仕立てしているんデス。", "zh": "艾米莉，请看。\n这里正在做临时缝制哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "484914cb97b9864cc5b9a85308653a1cc805d326b03af8f6e747c67ed138a307", "ja": "まぁ、ここで……あら？\n白い布かと思ったら、黒い線で模様が描かれてますね？", "zh": "哎呀，在这里……咦？\n我还以为是白布，上面却用黑线画着花纹呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1023_poru", "source_sha256": "f08ab758099c4d5bfc291911a135ac060b1fcb5834e7eb9691bcbc599aaa822f", "ja": "ハイ、墨で下書きをしてマス。そのあと、一度着物の\n形にして、模様がズレていないか確認してるんデス。", "zh": "是的，我正在用墨汁打草稿。之后会先做成和服的形状，确认图案有没有错位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "ed7552eb302521d8c82f26fe8d3fd797a8488ca8a3857c1134e8149d8b631348", "ja": "なるほど。とても細やかなお仕事なのですね。\nあれほど見事な着物に仕上がるのも納得です。", "zh": "原来如此。这真是一项非常细致的工作呢。\n难怪能做出那样精美的和服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1025_poru", "source_sha256": "96261c10ed948c6d737482539f3182f88c9f7d1b3fe2fb6861ced3da2fc91320", "ja": "特に絵羽模様は、一枚の着物で図案が繋がっているのが\n特徴で、とても難しい技術が必要デス。", "zh": "尤其是绘羽纹样，图案能在一件和服上连贯起来是其特点，需要非常高超的技艺。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1026_poru", "source_sha256": "93f242f1f5b979e3289e1b919123cb44001248ecfa16ad39a51ea13573b08a05", "ja": "でも職人の数は年々減っていて……。\n私は伝統を守るため、ニホンにきマシタ！", "zh": "可是，工匠的数量一年比一年少……  \n为了守护传统，我来到了日本！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "159277288b0025f87916fcef71ca4e4bb47794411f9b3ccad2091e4c6139971b", "ja": "Wow！　とても素晴らしい志だと思います。\n私もポールさんを見習わなくては……！", "zh": "Wow！真是非常了不起的志向呢。\n我也必须要向保罗先生好好学习……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1028_p", "source_sha256": "14f4afda118893b0f15b7bebd07f4bd37f4e5c3010988bf15bf2b228fe3ed42b", "ja": "（ポールさんの熱意を受け、エミリーも意欲的に\n質問をしていく。この二人いいコンビだ……！）", "zh": "（保罗先生的热情感染了艾米莉，她也积极地提起了问题。这两人真是好搭档啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1030_poru", "source_sha256": "9f900922fd0f051284d08011f19dd86bc44949de6eb2d4250fac50f13b18ed4e", "ja": "ここでは生地に色をつけてマス。筆や刷毛を使って、\n染料を挿す……『挿し友禅』ともいいマス。", "zh": "在这里给布料上色。用画笔或排笔蘸取染料进行点染……这也叫作“插染友禅”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1031_032emi", "source_sha256": "d51f7fcb3c73fd7d49684036db9e82ae7fcdc48152ed52327b20bd235ada2dc1", "ja": "Oh！　ひとつひとつの模様に、\n色付けしてるんですね。とても細かい作業です……！", "zh": "Oh！　是在给每一个花纹\n上色呢。真是非常细致的工序……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1032_sennndaikouboutyou", "source_sha256": "558e3f98083efa9679916a500ede70d0291c78ea5d89017e5124ec4b01f2f7dd", "ja": "お前達！　こんなところで何をしてるッ！", "zh": "你们！在这种地方干什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1034_poru", "source_sha256": "dbd88c1c495e3ea28a250ffd2ab990bc170fb2cae43f52b74e8fe7cb02ddb38b", "ja": "先代さん！　こちらはほら、例の取材の方たちで。\n着物の作り方を紹介するムービーの撮影中デス！", "zh": "前代！他们就是之前提到的采访人员。\n现在正在拍摄介绍和服制作方法的视频哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1035_032emi", "source_sha256": "f19d82f8302be1d7dcc5ed1322a69de7b792293303650d16504a98f261ff6873", "ja": "せんだいさま？", "zh": "前任工房长？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1036_poru", "source_sha256": "30027b99002bc395db84ab643998244b38067fbfb40d7d4166af2ffda82a68d4", "ja": "ハイ。前の工房長さんデス。\n素晴らしい技術を持った、尊敬する職人さんデス。", "zh": "是的。是之前那位工坊长。\n\n是一位拥有精湛技艺、令人尊敬的工匠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1037_sennndaikouboutyou", "source_sha256": "de8f429f91dbad2b362b802d6c967af11107bde47a8480ade8a246b0158ffa4e", "ja": "フン。取材だかなんだか知らんが、\nとっとと帰ってくれ！　作業の邪魔だ！", "zh": "哼。什么采访之类的我不管，  \n赶紧回去！别妨碍我干活！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1038_poru", "source_sha256": "5517ff2915f1981f143a4202b1c66f7ce952a8fe1c022746ca1f792b4849c0c7", "ja": "先代さん……。", "zh": "前代……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1040_p", "source_sha256": "e3253132aa6bd2c85780fbceb4784f7738f4fc7c7c5af90b779e6d7030a32bbf", "ja": "（収録を続行できる雰囲気ではなくなり、\n一旦、休憩を挟むことになった……）", "zh": "（已经没有办法继续录制了，只好先休息一会儿……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1041_023aka", "source_sha256": "a4c2fa4263485512685ef66445bafaee609a0fb3eb21f8ae44e806d4432d250b", "ja": "いやー、ビックリした。ちなみに茜ちゃん達は、\nガヤでいい子にしてたからね？　騒いでないからね？", "zh": "哎呀——吓了我一跳。顺便说一句，小茜他们一直乖乖待着呢？没有吵闹哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1042_014mir", "source_sha256": "7a99f83cbf523df010b5bf5700cfd0933222dacac7a0c23b0b9ab400a39d83ce", "ja": "でも、やっぱり人数多すぎたのかも……。\n私が行きたいなんて言っちゃったから……。", "zh": "不过，果然还是人太多了吧……  \n都怪我说了想去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1043_poru", "source_sha256": "30f97d3d832134f10fdddf5cf790ac63680f72aa553881cf4dc94916ae6e77a7", "ja": "それは違いマス！　私達はできるだけたくさんの人に\n着物作りの現場を見て欲しいデス。", "zh": "才不是这样！我们希望尽可能让更多人看看制作和服的现场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1044_poru", "source_sha256": "847e18a3f1cc3f990253707408f59c2f37b929bdd26242fa3e42bf380a095cd3", "ja": "ただ、先代さんは、裏側を見せるのが好きではなく。\n……今回もあまり乗り気じゃなかったのデス。", "zh": "不过，前代不喜欢让人看到幕后。……这次也没什么兴致。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1045_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7f6f6826aa350c00ac51ae828668c1703c81d410642db3ea2d9bfc2e7290e9c5", "ja": "作品がすべてってことか。なんか、わかるな～。\nアタシらもあるもんね、そういうトコ。", "zh": "作品才是一切吗？总觉得我能理解呢～我们也有那样的地方嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1046_013hib", "source_sha256": "76ba293eb2a0a49ef0f658a3402f20e2c05e39afd5482c026f13f33e158d4c0f", "ja": "うん、一番見て欲しいのはステージだからね。", "zh": "嗯，最希望你看到的还是舞台嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1047_poru", "source_sha256": "f4ae28dd4f711cc9e87f2b31e2f65715eca3a966147d3aefa4f2eb7362c29f22", "ja": "でも今回の動画は、この工房がステージなのデス。\nですから、気にしないでください。", "zh": "不过，这次的视频会以这间工坊作为舞台。\n所以，请不用在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1048_032emi", "source_sha256": "3ca47ad911e96ea378659d815f69e9a656d29be327b65945784a3dca5bddabbe", "ja": "……。つかぬことをお聞きしますが、\nポールさんはなぜこの工房を選んだのですか？", "zh": "……冒昧问一句，保罗先生为什么选择了这间工坊呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1049_poru", "source_sha256": "84097b564d890ca8440ae1f72683c8cd50becc3e1b66d8f4076b183a3a32d3be", "ja": "……実は私、フランスで画家をしてマシタ。昔から\n絵を描くのが好きで。……でも、全然売れなかった。", "zh": "……其实我以前在法国当过画家。自幼\n就很喜欢画画。……但是，完全卖不出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1050_poru", "source_sha256": "ad334aa991e0ab76fa554cfcee5cb52cd1a4710a17194c95d7928b44417aae44", "ja": "それで諦めようとした時、美しい着物に出会いマシタ。\nそれが先代さんが手がけた着物デス。", "zh": "就在准备放弃的时候，遇到了一件美丽的和服。\n那是前代制作的和服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1051_014mir", "source_sha256": "6d98522f418ba2c76cf13065c2fbd94a1589cc635bd584382992b15ad9a6a4ef", "ja": "わぁ、運命って感じですね！\nそれで、その先代さんがいるここを探したんですか？", "zh": "哇，感觉像是命运呢！\n所以，你才找到了前任坊主所在的这里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1052_poru", "source_sha256": "4222729c80b87d58c9d860fe724c02e09cc80cd1d887f0fb4f952effdba96969", "ja": "ハイ。今の工房長さんは、私のような外国人を\n受け入れてくれマシタ。でも先代さんは……。", "zh": "是的。现在的工房长愿意接纳像我这样的外国人。可是上一任就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1053_p", "source_sha256": "a37fd7e3d4ff8a5a78a0ef43aa823aa39d2f84925494212627bd0e323735da02", "ja": "先程のこともそうですが……\nあまり外の人間を歓迎していない感じですか？", "zh": "刚才的事也是这样……您是不是不太欢迎外来的人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1054_poru", "source_sha256": "77cdf2eaa7f2313e1a5cd6df7bf3428cf8fe3bf6b83d79fb48b8cfb21c4dcac7", "ja": "ハイ。着物はニホンの伝統文化で、この土地の文化。\nここの空気と水で育った人間が作るのがホンスジだと。", "zh": "是的。和服是日本的传统文化，也是这片土地的文化。由在这里的空气和水滋养长大的人制作，才是正道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1055_poru", "source_sha256": "f16472487e753491682edd069b5da5fa6f1fc9eb077bbce07757614cd44c8f0e", "ja": "私も、それはわかりマス。伝統が染みついてない\n外の人間の私に、同じモノは作れないデスカラ。", "zh": "我也明白这一点。因为对我这个没有浸染传统的外来者来说，是做不出同样的东西的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1056_poru", "source_sha256": "51e29afe11f2022f69716cfc52b5c74de6846ff8f3a052581545047f0655cf71", "ja": "でも私は諦めマセン！　先代さんと同じモノは無理でも\n同じくらい、誰かを感動させる着物を作りたいのデス！", "zh": "不过我不会放弃！即使无法做出和前代一样的东西，我也想制作出同样能感动某个人的和服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1057_032emi", "source_sha256": "766ba07fe6b6e099dfe5102cf36fc9138b3e8abb54b2b10611ee4b1fb436d4a2", "ja": "ポールさん……。", "zh": "保罗先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1058_poru", "source_sha256": "58a8748ef7790d2ccfb9b5b1b7766cc99272d72625a938dd0e97235d3db38fc8", "ja": "まあ、まだ失敗ばかりデスケド。\nでも、エミリーさんのおかげで頑張れマス！", "zh": "虽然现在还净是失败就是了。\n但是，多亏了艾米莉，我才能加倍努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1059_032emi", "source_sha256": "61d2fc98a8050fc393e0bda276b9f6a0fac60407e96b2ecc4207eac9d8e403ec", "ja": "……えっ？　私ですか？　い、いえ、動画もまだ\n完成していませんし、私は何も……。", "zh": "……诶？我吗？不、不是的，视频也还\n没有做完，我其实什么都……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1060_poru", "source_sha256": "0317dbafc8e702c49b3ecede071b60870fe01d946c500729ec75f24708ff3385", "ja": "エミリーさんをテレビで見た時、驚きました。\n私と同じ、ニホンで頑張ってる外国人がいるんだって。", "zh": "在电视上看到艾米莉时，我很惊讶。\n原来有和我一样，在日本努力生活的外国人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1061_poru", "source_sha256": "bd95c7b672b0740988edd62135bc17e3ffbb2e2666e1ab91947825905244e15d", "ja": "それからエミリーさんのこと、応援してマス。\nいつも歌を聞いて、元気もらってマスヨ！", "zh": "另外，我也在为艾米莉小姐加油。\n总是听你的歌，从中获得活力哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1062_032emi", "source_sha256": "dc129143deabbb58fd950f1224d00ffe87ffd18aff5985bb67c10d5ae056d366", "ja": "そ、そうだったのですか！？", "zh": "原、原来是这样吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1063_poru", "source_sha256": "92de735d720093d2e61b355c6ceb2b2157de7f45641f20602febc2062a7a03de", "ja": "ハイ！　だから今回、動画のキャスティングでも、\nエミリーさんをプッシュしマシタ。職権乱用デス！", "zh": "嗨！所以这次在视频选角时，我也力推了艾米莉小姐。滥用职权！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1064_023aka", "source_sha256": "7b7391ec7b67975e307cc27d67b8dd9040316355078dc292dbf78e8ccb5304c5", "ja": "おおっ、健やかな笑顔で言い切った！", "zh": "哦哦！竟然面带健康的笑容把话说得斩钉截铁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1065_poru", "source_sha256": "e34cce18ffd900f41884979065ac09188236c26b9c731c5fc45c036c7ed59b4d", "ja": "そして、みなさんからも元気もらってマス。\nニホンのアイドル、素晴らしいデス！", "zh": "而且，我也从大家那里获得了活力。\n日本的偶像，真是太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1066_032emi", "source_sha256": "6e68f2c7b35353742369a2ebba280f332e852042b9b34f54f0b342ef5cf7afa8", "ja": "あ……ありがとうございます。\n私達も、ご期待にお応えできるように……。", "zh": "啊……谢谢大家。\n我们也会努力不辜负大家的期待……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1067_032emi", "source_sha256": "6a9e304fc9f0a9ec7ea5a8e460f3190e180a7276550142d82b8ae9f42e8c1703", "ja": "ポールさんに負けないように、憧れを追いかけて。\n……頑張りますね！", "zh": "为了不输给保罗先生，我会追逐憧憬。\n……我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1068_staff", "source_sha256": "c3dd460c0d4d5d6d8e92a0ee7f5066d31a8120708aa134cb87563132923bf3a1", "ja": "すみません！　あらためて許可いただきましたので、\n収録再開しまーす！", "zh": "不好意思！我重新获得许可了，\n所以现在继续录制啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1069_p", "source_sha256": "3e36fe5d657c2facac71d0230437f9e80f4f4184acaaa0aa2dee7b288ecb635a", "ja": "（先代さんにも納得してもらえたのか、\nその後の撮影は順調に進み……）", "zh": "（前辈应该也接受了吧，之后的拍摄顺利地进行着……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1070_jyoseisyokunin", "source_sha256": "41a178d89bb45652d4eae473436511d03d31aab348687a092815a5d6f863bd21", "ja": "最後に、この工房で作られた着物をご用意しました。\nうちは留め袖に振袖、訪問着と手掛けているんです。", "zh": "最后，我们为您准备了这间工坊制作的和服。\n我们承接留袖、振袖和访问着的制作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1071_poru", "source_sha256": "d4b8b6f54d30c8b92b767c7949e305532ef029f9e9a72cfbf449f22b52d84db7", "ja": "Oh……何回見ても、美しいデス！", "zh": "Oh……无论看多少次，都太美丽了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1072_032emi", "source_sha256": "3f87f4e6355d75efe9667f62a636df07b8dc4164a5903e916c5986119fc48925", "ja": "はい♪　本当に絵画のようで……あ。\n奥にあるものは、ずいぶん趣が違いますね？", "zh": "是啊♪真的就像一幅画……啊。里面那件，风格很不一样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1073_jyoseisyokunin", "source_sha256": "44467f7d51746d5688ffa93075fc48eecf0e08ccd7bf3ea1fe513be93f6ff062", "ja": "それはポールさんがデザインした着物です。\n私たちでは思いつかない図案で、素敵ですよね。", "zh": "那是保罗先生设计的和服。\n图案是我们想不到的，真棒呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1074_jyoseisyokunin", "source_sha256": "c4bf2ad149ea943fa07bdce8c58f72e788805c0b22e084e47ee0b8d7394ab848", "ja": "SNSで話題になって、若い人に興味を持ってもらえる\nきっかけになったんですよ。", "zh": "在社交网络上引发了话题，成了让年轻人产生兴趣的契机呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1075_032emi", "source_sha256": "75accb33b114df5ede2721db4b863f68f19d2d65b80ede80c81b5318fac0b842", "ja": "そうだったんですね。すばらしいです！\nポールさんの努力の賜物ですね♪", "zh": "原来是这样啊。太棒了！\n这都是保罗先生努力的成果呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1076_poru", "source_sha256": "0855f2ca1b3b4b71766383d49344d7489b258b6dd3a50f837c5c61ada5ec0975", "ja": "そ、そんなコトハ……。私は半人前デス。\nまだまだ精進しないといけマセン。", "zh": "哪、哪有那回事……我还只是个半吊子。\n还得继续努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1077_032emi", "source_sha256": "ec2ecf953078044ca4a5b95699f296434ad48f67ac4eb73070a3f1feeab02736", "ja": "……伝統の知恵や技術を、未来に残していくことは\nとても大変で難しいことだと思います。", "zh": "……我认为，将传统的智慧与技艺传承给未来，\n是一件非常艰辛又困难的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1078_032emi", "source_sha256": "62e4a2962b07c046e7775a1c466b88b7ec909321924ffc60d6bdcde62056ba69", "ja": "きっと強い想いが必要で……。ですが、その想いを\n持ち続ける限り、実現できるとも思います。", "zh": "一定需要强烈的心意……不过，只要始终怀抱着这份心意，我相信就一定能够实现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1079_032emi", "source_sha256": "2f7b9d0ef138d1b02b26efc20b2cccd59665e3749f69b6aad56be1c4e1f4111f", "ja": "たとえ、いつ、どこで。\nその想いを抱こうとも……。", "zh": "无论何时，无论何地。  \n即使怀抱着那份心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1080_032emi", "source_sha256": "bd2bbb673176e83acdaefc7b89bc38978d970654272fcaccf384896f7e7db96c", "ja": "この動画をみて、少しでも着物に、日本の伝統文化に\n興味を抱いていただけたら嬉しいです♪", "zh": "如果看了这段视频，哪怕只对和服、对日本传统文化产生一点兴趣，我也会很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1081_p", "source_sha256": "1b9224d5f2ed466abe47b4f9edd37480d9756b30183ab27811e74cf8f745038f", "ja": "（こうして、途中予想外なことも起きたものの、\n無事に撮影は終了した）", "zh": "（就这样，虽然中途发生了些意料之外的事，但拍摄还是顺利结束了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1082_p", "source_sha256": "da24b66fef890dfbdd379f79dccdfda19b34b0a0fcf4841dc269d04a58787c0f", "ja": "撤収作業も終わったし、帰ろうか。\nみんな、揃って……あれ？　エミリーは？", "zh": "收拾工作也结束了，回去吧。\n大家都到齐了……咦？艾米莉呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1083_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a4baa897e104e67689f3a2a46dfd6885cb8fdeb0564637ff502e121d991442fb", "ja": "{$P$}と一緒じゃなかったんだ？\nさっき忘れ物したって、工房に戻ったよ？", "zh": "原来没跟{$P$}在一起啊？\n她刚才说落了东西，回作坊去了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1084_p", "source_sha256": "3285b75ce241b8f8cdb75340d259ef6717b83b9fa5bf90cd495e6bb12fc68b8d", "ja": "エミリーが？　珍しいな……。\nわかった、ちょっと様子を見てくるよ。", "zh": "艾米莉吗？真少见啊……\n知道了，我去看看她的情况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1085_p", "source_sha256": "b11ba9eac299da74b7382622d55e04bf914c44a30c568fb0c148fb7cc4300bcc", "ja": "（いたいた……うん？　エミリーが話してるのは……\nさっきの先代さんじゃないか？）", "zh": "（找到了……嗯？艾米莉正在和谁说话……那不是刚才那位前辈吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1086_sennndaikouboutyou", "source_sha256": "bf35a2b55cc9b48e67c43a58df4474d491d2278cc908baa5610c23076cbed98c", "ja": "なんだ、あんた。取材は終わったのに、\nまだ帰ってなかったのか！", "zh": "什么啊，是你。采访都结束了，居然还没回去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1087_032emi", "source_sha256": "64c276dc9e4f8f01ec47c4cbb743c730ea1c7cd953984f0c9306f09cc2ee6803", "ja": "は、はい……あの、先代様にどうしても、\n聞いていただきたいことがあって。", "zh": "是、是……那个，我有件事无论如何都想请教先代大人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1088_032emi", "source_sha256": "437e88549e4d6158267b4bd61c3bdc636181c259701b3d8c3386436c59d47342", "ja": "着物がどのように作られていくのか……。\n今日の取材で本当によくわかりました。", "zh": "关于和服是如何制作出来的……通过今天的采访，我真的彻底明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1089_032emi", "source_sha256": "fac23b231cf38509a385352901bd55888aed46f86988c7c55d47a5688428b67f", "ja": "ひとつひとつの工程はもちろん、材料である糸や染料も\nその前の水も空気も、もしかしたら鳥の声までも。", "zh": "不仅是每一道工序，就连作为材料的丝线和染料，甚至是制作前所需的水、空气，说不定连鸟儿的叫声也是如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1090_032emi", "source_sha256": "e6bf5a092395bed59e2eb3ba3f50f170271d5deca7acea34e56a4d21be9ff4d0", "ja": "すべてが繋がって、ひとつの着物という\n大きな感動が生み出されていくのですね。", "zh": "一切彼此相连，最终造就出一件和服这样令人无比感动的作品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1092_032emi", "source_sha256": "64e9cbec07fe94a54b39e39a1288f994080ea9f3e293ada9b93cd54464a108e0", "ja": "ここと繋がっていない、外から来た私達には……\n同じことはできないかも、しれません。……でも。", "zh": "对于与这里没有联系、从外面来到这里的我们……也许做不到同样的事……不过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1093_032emi", "source_sha256": "fa18e9fce2461abc2b1e690a070b7d8c8f83efffae3a3a839056d4f9ff7fbd75", "ja": "これから繋がることはできます。己の役目と向き合う\nことは、どこから来たとしても、できますから！", "zh": "从现在开始，我们可以建立联系。无论来自何方，都可以面对自己的职责，做到这一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1094_032emi", "source_sha256": "6a0248c66fcfff38ab997dca068655547e130b9f84c7debb36268cb3c5f94419", "ja": "それででき上がる模様は、どこか違うものになるかも\nしれませんけれど。どうか……。", "zh": "这样完成的图案，或许会变得有些不同。不过，还请……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1095_032emi", "source_sha256": "e43cdac99ee3c47958d4ebad6998ccded0cdf4160674ef2be28b4e928f95fddc", "ja": "その輪に入ることを、許して……認めていただけると\n嬉しいです。どうか……。", "zh": "如果能允许我……认可我加入那个圈子，我会很高兴。拜托了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1096_sennndaikouboutyou", "source_sha256": "4f2dabc1aa493940c6cd0039ce621a35382a8d11d965885c1ef90e26ee5922a0", "ja": "……。あのな。", "zh": "……。我说啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1097_032emi", "source_sha256": "e24e0aad3bfb5a8d6cc75050b1a018e261908a648aab4aec272edbc5d4afb214", "ja": "すっ、すみません、差し出がましいことを申しました！\nあの、本日は本当に、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "对、对不起，我说了些冒昧的话！\n那个，今天真的非常感谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1098_032emi", "source_sha256": "1490ff640bef91989faa5e44ba7e4b81c7f0a646654bf4fc996b74aac075fad5", "ja": "それと先代様の作られたお着物、本当に大好きです！\nそれも本当で、えっと……、し、失礼します……。", "zh": "还有，我真的非常喜欢先代大人制作的和服！\n这也是真的，那个……那、那么我先告辞了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1101_sennndaikouboutyou", "source_sha256": "19e9761a64e2ce7c409f0dc79bffc5392dc9f6caf95e15d949c757c17d6e0897", "ja": "おい、そこの。\nあんたが責任者だったな。", "zh": "喂，那边那个。你就是负责人吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1102_p", "source_sha256": "0db9d9f06a2ae38c08c0ac5f2b0b0fca8c11721dd012d926754e7a624536a196", "ja": "あ、はい。\nお気づきでしたか……。", "zh": "啊，是。\n您注意到了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1103_sennndaikouboutyou", "source_sha256": "2bf4376be6d6eaaa04e5b6889a545ccf21250ca5a128bff5036ad7b12cdf8c0f", "ja": "当たり前だ。あの子に伝えてくれ。\nそんなもの、とっくに認めてるってな。", "zh": "那是当然。替我转告那孩子，\n那种事情，我早就已经认可了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1104_p", "source_sha256": "7ba8b48e5bf091c58909fd09ce37174acf7593bed6a9677b33315c4093df30a0", "ja": "……。\nわかりました。", "zh": "……。\n我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_147_1105_p", "source_sha256": "66274d884cd25ff2744064f2532262b372bff9b41a73c83a24219dba5a38e3e4", "ja": "でも、できればご自分でお願いしますね。\n……エミリーは、自分で伝えたんですから。", "zh": "不过，如果可以的话，还是请您亲自来。\n……毕竟，艾米莉也是亲自传达的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
